ime in a human-readable format.\n        """\n        word_count = TextAnalyzer.count_words(text)\n        reading_time = TextAnalyzer.estimate_reading_time(word_count)\n        return f"Estimated reading time: {reading_time:.2f} minutes for {word_count} words."\n    def calculate_reading_time_with_details(self, text: str) -> str:\n        """\n        Calculate the estimated reading time for a given text with additional details.\n        Args:\n            text (str): The input text to analyze.\n        Returns:\n            str: Detailed estimated reading time in a human-readable format.\n        """\n        word_count = TextAnalyzer.count_words(text)\n        reading_time = TextAnalyzer.estimate_reading_time(word_count)\n        return f"Detailed reading time estimate: {reading_time:.2f} minutes for {word_count} words."\n    def calculate_reading_time_for_multiple_texts(self, texts: List[str]) -> List[str]:\n        """\n        Calculate the estimated reading time for multiple texts.\n        Args:\n            texts (List[str]): A list of input texts to analyze.\n        Returns:\n            List[str]: A list of estimated reading times for each text in a human-readable format.\n        """\n        estimates = []\n        for text in texts:\n            word_count = TextAnalyzer.count_words(text)\n            reading_time = TextAnalyzer.estimate_reading_time(word_count)\n            estimates.append(f"Estimated reading time for text: {reading_time:.2f} minutes.")\n        return estimates\n', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'mode': 'overwrite'}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.00500178337097168
