sole.\n\n3. **Specify Reading Speed**: If desired, adjust the reading speed (in words per minute) before calculating the reading time. The default reading speed is typically set at 200 words per minute.\n\n4. **Get Results**: After entering the text and adjusting the reading speed, the calculator will display the estimated reading time.\n\n## Conclusion\nThe Reading Time Calculator is a straightforward yet powerful tool that enhances reading efficiency. By following the instructions above, users can easily set up and utilize the software for their reading time needs.\n\nFor further assistance, feel free to reach out or consult the documentation in the `docs` directory.', 'encoding': 'utf-8', 'mode': 'overwrite'}, 'stage': 'before'} 
